kupi (@VERSION@) kali-rolling; urgency=medium

  * Initial release.
  * Drag-and-drop installer for .deb, .rpm, .AppImage, .run/.bin, .sh,
    tar/zip archives, .snap and .flatpak.
  * Live merged stdout/stderr via QProcess; Cancel button; outcome check
    on both exit code and error lines in the output.
  * Privilege escalation via pkexec, with per-type preflight prompts.
  * Archives are extracted and re-dispatched to an install script or a
    bundled .deb.

 -- Prismovector <info@prismovector.com>  @DATE@
